<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back 1.39 mln more shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back 1.39 mln more shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it bought back a further 1,394,600 shares between NZ$6.35 and $6.48 on Thursday as part of its NZ$1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>The shares closed at $6.37, down nine cents.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
